{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27253","headline":"钱塘赠武翊黄 · 章孝标","name":"钱塘赠武翊黄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曾将心劒作戈矛，一战名场造化愁。\n花锦文章开四面，天人科第上三头。\n鸳鸿待侣飞清禁，山水缘情住外州。\n时伴庾公看海月，好吟诗断望潮楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}